#
# Whether one period of a stream may be paid, in Sutra (trickle_rules.h
# TK3): due 1 to 2^53 - 1 minor units, after (the paying balance after
# it), room (the per-day stream cap left after it) and left (the stream's
# total left after it) not below zero, and the owner's approval standing
# (approved = 1). due, after, room and left are s9(18) and approved one
# digit: a value past its picture is refused, where pay.eve answers FALSE:
# held. The model posts only when both say TRUE.
record stream-pay
  due: s9(18)
  after: s9(18)
  room: s9(18)
  left: s9(18)
  approved: 9
procedure
  answer due >= 1 and due <= 9007199254740991 and after >= 0 and room >= 0 and left >= 0 and approved = 1
